	(text "TPSM365R6 adjustable buck | 12 V or 7.04 V variant, 600 mA, PGOOD divider" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edae044d-681d-5657-a9b4-560db82b7df3"))
	(text "High-voltage input to an adjustable 12 V or 7 V rail: TI TPSM365R6F 600 mA buck module, one family source with the FB top leg, the PGOOD bottom leg and the second output capacitor as the variant." (at 15.24 21.082 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1ad78d71-676c-5ede-a573-da51817947ec"))
	(text "Matching net labels are connected. Group order explains function; PCB placement priorities are stated below." (at 15.24 26.322 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f5c4db6-73b4-5824-9398-3ff809c2723f"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 15.24 36.482) (xy 279.54 36.482)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "15de27fb-524c-5d82-9216-0974832a7f35"))
	(text "1. Buck module, input bypass and output capacitors" (at 15.24 39.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "92533791-c102-5e8d-8fbb-bbcc866a1934"))
	(text "${77027786-e512-4279-8873-f7823879d911:REFERENCE} converts VIN to the adjustable VOUT. Three 1 uF 100 V capacitors (${f95b5b10-da22-42c8-a1b8-c720dfad9530:REFERENCE} to ${2a276073-862a-4b14-879e-c6c5d31c0047:REFERENCE}) and the 100 nF ${5f2314c4-c685-44d6-b330-b5d3dce06bee:REFERENCE} bypass VIN (pin 3) to GND at the module input; ${73a83f91-d923-49e7-b5a8-7ca69b0bd193:REFERENCE} (1 uF) bypasses the internal LDO output VCC (pin 8); ${312f2cf2-49bf-4bfd-96f4-5e3faeecc79e:REFERENCE} and" (at 15.24 43.172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35fcff93-2900-5b71-af83-3d97355c28e4"))
	(text "${67ad9dcd-0d50-4c3a-8ae7-819da694957b:REFERENCE} (10 uF) hold the output. ${67ad9dcd-0d50-4c3a-8ae7-819da694957b:REFERENCE} is unpopulated on the 7v variant. ${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} (variant: 110 k or 60.4 k) from VOUT and ${42475936-03bd-4a28-9ef1-da8c2819294a:REFERENCE} (10 k) to GND set FB to the 1.000 V reference. ${43807641-753b-409a-92b6-37ad6f3e833d:REFERENCE} (10 k) from VOUT and ${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE} (variant: 4.7 k or 10 k) to" (at 15.24 45.712 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e4903126-046e-5d55-85d7-70aed50344ac"))
	(text "GND pull the open-drain PGOOD up and set its high level. ${d5bba270-a6fc-419a-8a80-d6a2a4a678b9:REFERENCE} (7.87 k) from RT (pin 11) to GND programs the switching frequency." (at 15.24 48.252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6625b20b-d9f7-5147-ab03-1ef09e432c45"))
	(text "Buck module, integrated inductor" (at 20.32 170.864592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5806876f-9490-50e6-b73a-e7435b11a5ff"))
	(text "${f95b5b10-da22-42c8-a1b8-c720dfad9530:REFERENCE}, ${4aab0a05-3e08-4e5b-9055-655f7f38faa3:REFERENCE}, ${2a276073-862a-4b14-879e-c6c5d31c0047:REFERENCE}: VIN bulk, 1 uF 100 V; ${5f2314c4-c685-44d6-b330-b5d3dce06bee:REFERENCE}: VIN HF bypass, 100 nF" (at 20.32 173.404592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d032fc71-3dfa-5067-8483-f733c87d302d"))
	(text "${312f2cf2-49bf-4bfd-96f4-5e3faeecc79e:REFERENCE}: Output capacitor, 10 uF" (at 20.32 175.944592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a9455ed-4159-5531-854c-fa00ce94a232"))
	(text "${67ad9dcd-0d50-4c3a-8ae7-819da694957b:REFERENCE}: Output capacitor, 10 uF; DNP on 7v" (at 20.32 178.484592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c704cd9-943f-5ce0-83d4-b92d8d9c5486"))
	(text "${73a83f91-d923-49e7-b5a8-7ca69b0bd193:REFERENCE}: VCC LDO bypass, 1 uF" (at 20.32 181.024592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e6e62f7-88a3-517c-a4b8-7deed145d429"))
	(text "${d5bba270-a6fc-419a-8a80-d6a2a4a678b9:REFERENCE}: RT frequency-set resistor, 7.87 k" (at 20.32 183.564592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "28d2ad4c-b2ee-5f2b-933c-3f3b193c8c76"))
	(text "${43807641-753b-409a-92b6-37ad6f3e833d:REFERENCE}: PGOOD pull-up, 10 k" (at 20.32 186.104592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5ba59341-711b-55b2-8041-160a390027d0"))
	(text "${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE}: PGOOD bottom leg (variant)" (at 20.32 188.644592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "37fa4d50-3e51-5217-a137-a2ced82f97bc"))
	(text "${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE}: FB top leg (variant)" (at 20.32 191.184592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ae01533e-0add-5874-9098-8a576d09878a"))
	(text "${42475936-03bd-4a28-9ef1-da8c2819294a:REFERENCE}: FB bottom leg, 10 k" (at 20.32 193.724592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1c275b2-f4c7-592f-97e8-d7d4b1ee7265"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${5f2314c4-c685-44d6-b330-b5d3dce06bee:REFERENCE} (100 nF) closest to VIN (pin 3) and GND (pin 10), the 1 uF parts beside it; the input current loop is the noisiest on the block." (at 15.24 198.804592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d3df71ae-d83e-58bc-b5dc-70641c584680"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${73a83f91-d923-49e7-b5a8-7ca69b0bd193:REFERENCE} at VCC (pin 8) with a short return to pin 10." (at 15.24 202.614592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bdcba7b8-6c71-5962-9314-1518840c1d0e"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${312f2cf2-49bf-4bfd-96f4-5e3faeecc79e:REFERENCE} and ${67ad9dcd-0d50-4c3a-8ae7-819da694957b:REFERENCE} at VOUT (pin 4) with their GND ends at pin 10; keep the output loop short and on one layer." (at 15.24 206.424592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d122b60c-be74-5471-9944-69f11760d1a6"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${42475936-03bd-4a28-9ef1-da8c2819294a:REFERENCE} at FB (pin 9) and GND, ${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} beside it; the FB node must stay short and away from the switch node." (at 15.24 210.234592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "48d9df29-8b80-5147-be8a-fbea500a4138"))
	(text "PLACE: Anywhere between VOUT, pin 1 and the PGOOD port; low-current nodes." (at 15.24 214.044592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3d590b6e-cec0-5293-b06c-74e35bc43b6b"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${d5bba270-a6fc-419a-8a80-d6a2a4a678b9:REFERENCE} at pin 11 with a short return to pin 10." (at 15.24 217.854592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c0e5250f-06fd-5cec-8c92-fbee8bc0d2b8"))
	(text "ROUTE: Wide, short VIN copper from the capacitors into pin 3; no via between ${5f2314c4-c685-44d6-b330-b5d3dce06bee:REFERENCE} and the module if the layer allows it." (at 15.24 221.664592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d69e31b5-a37c-5b39-93f4-12d7aac4fac4"))
	(text "ROUTE: VCC stays inside the block; nothing else loads it." (at 15.24 225.474592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "470466c0-ee07-5f06-b062-8ccde5387f72"))
	(text "ROUTE: VOUT is block-local copper (PWR_12V_LOCAL); the board names and classes the net on its side of the sheet pin." (at 15.24 229.284592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eee98802-c454-5d4e-94c9-8076f94e586a"))
	(text "ROUTE: FB is a high-impedance node: no via stitching under it, no parallel run with VIN or VOUT copper." (at 15.24 233.094592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e610e4b-2966-5eb9-a083-8922eddd495a"))
	(text "ROUTE: PGOOD is a logic flag on the Default class; its high level is the divider's, 3.84 V or 3.52 V." (at 15.24 236.904592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "784bda39-83fb-5d73-a00b-d6b040567d6c"))
	(text "ROUTE: RT is a sensitive analog node; keep it short and away from the switch node." (at 15.24 240.714592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f45d39b-b716-5549-81bd-d469995daf8f"))
	(text "INTERFACES" (at 287.16 36.482 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f471214-2ac4-5b11-87d9-490e0083e91d"))
	(text "3.6 to 65 V input on VIN (pin 3) and EN (pin 2, tied: always enabled)." (at 287.16 46.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "33ce38f2-925c-5d15-b997-a06452919237"))
	(text "Adjustable output set by the FB divider: 12.0 V (12v) or 7.04 V (7v); 600 mA." (at 287.16 59.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d71d73b-91b3-54fa-b4b5-a4ab1c39f251"))
	(text "Return for the module (pin 10), the dividers and every capacitor." (at 287.16 72.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c7bfd47c-3225-5ac7-b249-461ca99eaed4"))
	(text "PGOOD divider midpoint (${43807641-753b-409a-92b6-37ad6f3e833d:REFERENCE} 10 k over ${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE}): 3.84 V high on 12v, 3.52 V on 7v." (at 287.16 85.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ee6a252a-601e-59ff-ac7d-47e8141fcd87"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 287.16 100.33) (xy 404.76 100.33)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "704ad2c6-95b5-5e0a-b801-4cf2886b1dd9"))
	(text "INTERNAL NETS" (at 287.16 102.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8d39efd6-511e-5021-91ae-69340634da24"))
	(text "FB: Feedback (pin 9) against the 1.000 V reference: ${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} from VOUT over ${42475936-03bd-4a28-9ef1-da8c2819294a:REFERENCE} (10 k) to GND." (at 287.16 107.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "440eec2b-83fe-5cc8-9902-8d2052c6e2c2"))
	(text "RT: RT (pin 11) to GND through ${d5bba270-a6fc-419a-8a80-d6a2a4a678b9:REFERENCE} (7.87 k), which programs the switching frequency." (at 287.16 110.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66813c3b-cfab-551c-a9a7-21fbd7b69c4d"))
	(text "VCC: Internal LDO output (pin 8), bypassed by ${73a83f91-d923-49e7-b5a8-7ca69b0bd193:REFERENCE} (1 uF)." (at 287.16 114.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "67662715-5224-59f7-8a38-4f52f97dc867"))
	(text "SW: Switch node of the module's integrated inductor: pins 5 and 6 tied to each other, nothing external." (at 287.16 118.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c3850d0a-dda6-56fe-81e7-dd6aebbe942f"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 287.16 129.88) (xy 404.76 129.88)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "3d7fb23d-cb0a-5b8d-873c-61bb43cc0186"))
	(text "OPERATION" (at 287.16 132.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fc197b76-23da-53fb-95ab-a5d9c9d2475d"))
	(text "Signal path: VIN (3.6 to 65 V after start-up, UVLO rising 3.4 V typical) enters VIN (pin 3) and EN (pin 2, tied to" (at 287.16 136.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "96a302b4-bc17-5f39-90a2-3c2ef61aa934"))
	(text "VIN, so the module runs whenever input is present); the integrated-inductor module delivers VOUT (pin 4), 600 mA" (at 287.16 139.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60486f52-c842-50bd-899c-1d632ea984f8"))
	(text "maximum, regulated so that FB (pin 9) sits at the 1.000 V reference (0.985 to 1.010 V): VOUT = 1 V x (1 +" (at 287.16 141.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "41d7d26a-ebae-57a1-9978-00329b7e09cb"))
	(text "${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} / ${42475936-03bd-4a28-9ef1-da8c2819294a:REFERENCE})." (at 287.16 144.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35758fea-697b-543e-8e18-d2d695040054"))
	(text "Variants: 12v fits ${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} = 110 k (OW-PASS-FRC0402F1103TS) and ${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE} = 4.7 k with both 10 uF output" (at 287.16 148 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dde70bf0-32ff-57d5-87e5-9b53c5d17f8c"))
	(text "capacitors, 12.0 V; 7v fits ${08609131-beba-453c-b592-e0da6397edbe:REFERENCE} = 60.4 k (OW-PASS-0402WGF6042TCE) and ${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE} = 10 k and leaves" (at 287.16 150.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "24a43684-68be-51d3-b37c-9151af430fea"))
	(text "${67ad9dcd-0d50-4c3a-8ae7-819da694957b:REFERENCE} unpopulated, 7.04 V. One schematic and one copper serve both variants; only those three parts differ," (at 287.16 153.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bb5450c9-e8b8-5a1b-90cf-8b2b1483a4b0"))
	(text "and each set point must stay inside the reference-tolerance window (12.000 V nominal, 11.82 to 12.12 V; 7.04 V" (at 287.16 155.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3985872b-005d-59ca-80f3-4f476066f2e1"))
	(text "nominal, 6.93 to 7.11 V)." (at 287.16 158.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76d27088-36a6-5e30-aa6b-1924555b4a55"))
	(text "PGOOD (pin 1) is the module's open-drain window comparator (high inside the window, rising at about 107 % and" (at 287.16 161.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b27c2b8a-d9e3-5c0e-b65d-1ccb3d4164ad"))
	(text "falling at about 94 % of the set point, 25 us deglitch); the port is the divider midpoint, ${43807641-753b-409a-92b6-37ad6f3e833d:REFERENCE} (10 k) from" (at 287.16 164.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29d7e38f-fdbc-52e8-9c7d-7b09c1c7a9bb"))
	(text "VOUT over ${c2dd02a2-41d8-4ec2-bda2-ffa93cf05d4b:REFERENCE} to GND, so its high level is about 3.84 V on the 12 V variant and 3.52 V on the 7 V variant." (at 287.16 167.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0247bbc7-8d72-52e2-80d8-6bc3be9cae72"))
	(text "3.84 V is above a 3.3 V logic input's absolute maximum: a 3.3 V host needs a 5 V-tolerant input or its own" (at 287.16 169.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "16fade75-374d-5354-88f2-2e4b31303dd1"))
	(text "divider." (at 287.16 172.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "376a5be4-209b-559f-ac7c-607709bf2a6e"))
	(text "RT (pin 11) to GND through ${d5bba270-a6fc-419a-8a80-d6a2a4a678b9:REFERENCE} (7.87 k) programs the switching frequency; it is a block value, not a variant" (at 287.16 175.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "374fd653-e007-5d9a-9ac1-cf75288e20ba"))
	(text "(the datasheet gives the two pin-strap frequencies, 2.2 MHz with RT at GND and 1 MHz with RT at VCC; a resistor" (at 287.16 178.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "516592d0-ab26-503e-89ad-f59ddea8c2e8"))
	(text "sets a frequency in between). VCC (pin 8) is the internal LDO output, bypassed by ${73a83f91-d923-49e7-b5a8-7ca69b0bd193:REFERENCE}. BOOT (pin 7) is left" (at 287.16 181.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56b3d45d-819a-5e3b-9fb4-eb022a43671a"))
	(text "open and the SW pins (5, 6) are tied only to each other, as the block was drawn and built." (at 287.16 183.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "47c47927-d112-53f2-9053-bc1fe972dc0c"))
	(text "Bypass: three 1 uF 100 V 1206 capacitors (${f95b5b10-da22-42c8-a1b8-c720dfad9530:REFERENCE} to ${2a276073-862a-4b14-879e-c6c5d31c0047:REFERENCE}) and a 100 nF 0603 (${5f2314c4-c685-44d6-b330-b5d3dce06bee:REFERENCE}) at VIN; the 10" (at 287.16 187.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e1c68e8-b663-574d-bd6e-bc43e09e6156"))
	(text "uF 25 V output capacitors sit at about 48 % (12 V) and 28 % (7 V) of their rating, inside the family's 60 %" (at 287.16 189.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a2a8336e-988a-5d0d-93a1-c63843429b6b"))
	(text "voltage-derating rule. Current limits from the datasheet: high-side short-circuit 1 A typical, low-side 0.7 A" (at 287.16 192.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f98e63e5-074c-50a6-978d-e531d89ded07"))
	(text "typical." (at 287.16 194.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f8b08e1f-60cc-505a-a591-a3931d42c8cd"))
	(text "The placing board provides the VIN entry on its own class (the block's PWR_HV_LOCAL copper is block-local), a" (at 287.16 198.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8023be10-63a1-5b5f-9b92-7d796a0ce745"))
	(text "load of at most 600 mA, its own name for the VOUT net (the port is VOUT because the variant sets the voltage;" (at 287.16 201.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a6617dde-16a4-5eaf-8c14-8c8d8a99238e"))
	(text "its copper is PWR_12V_LOCAL) and the thermal path: RthJA 56.3 C/W on a JEDEC 4-layer board, so give the" (at 287.16 203.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be28eac5-5212-5fb6-8703-d26841c5cfdf"))
	(text "module's pad a ground pour and vias." (at 287.16 206.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "02e5e653-61e2-50b8-92ee-a30ff1cf4fd3"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 287.16 217.85) (xy 404.76 217.85)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0ca68d02-136a-5df8-b599-6abfb346a582"))
	(text "DESIGN CONTRACT" (at 287.16 220.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "34134fe5-b77e-575a-8a1e-421a36557257"))
	(text "High-voltage input to an adjustable 12 V or 7 V rail: TI TPSM365R6F 600 mA buck module, one family source" (at 287.16 224.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf86aed8-e3a9-5bf0-b5ee-481f7a52bdf9"))
	(text "with the FB top leg, the PGOOD bottom leg and the second output capacitor as the variant." (at 287.16 227.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bafece09-b894-52b9-b3bf-1bd63907c0a9"))
